{
  "//": "require-await is off pod-wide (matches @qvac/inference). Many functions here keep an async signature for interface conformance — RPC handlers, plugin factories, config loaders, and async test callbacks — without awaiting internally. Blanket-off hides genuinely missing awaits, so a real fix is per-line `// lunte-disable-line require-await` on the intentional cases; that inlining is deferred to avoid churning every file.",
  "rules": {
    "require-await": "off"
  }
}
